                <head>Correspondence With the German Delegation Regarding the Terms of Peace:</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note Concerning Correspondence
                        With<lb/>The German Delegation Regarding<lb/>The Terms of Peace</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center">The greater number of the notes exchanged between the
                    German<lb/>delegation and the Peace Conference regarding the terms<lb/>of peace
                    appear as appendices to the minutes of the<lb/>Council of Four. The following
                    pages contain<lb/>notes which are not appended to the minutes<lb/>and which
                    appear in the files as separate<lb/>documents.</p>
















